This project is a reimplementation of the InstantDB server
(https://github.com/instantdb/instant). Much of the Rust code under crates/
follows the behaviour and structure of the original Clojure server, and its
comments cite the original source files. The original InstantDB code is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, a copy of which is in
LEGACY/LICENSE.md. Changes: the server was rewritten in Rust; see the git
history for details.

The Docker image also contains the InstantDB database migrations
(LEGACY/server/resources/migrations, installed at /migrations), which are
distributed unmodified under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
